  "preparation": "Real trunk and branch geometry simplified with meshoptimizer. Each connected leaf surface fitted in its original UV space to an alpha-masked card; original species-specific atlases retained. Three levels preserve all leaves / one half / one eighth, with modest coverage compensation at distance. Albedo 1024, normal and packed AO/roughness/metallic 512; all embedded in glTF. Rooted Y-up geometry, scaled to approximately 7.5 metres before terrain scatter scaling.",
